ed the raw,\nunescaped \u003cinput\u003e tag HTML as a regex pattern via\ninputHtml.replaceAll(inputHtml, TAG_CLOSE) to collapse it down to \"/\u003e\"\nbefore splicing in the boolean yes/no radio markup. Any regex\nmetacharacter in the tag's stored title/value attributes (e.g. a bare\n\"[\") can fail Pattern.compile with PatternSyntaxException, or produce\nwrong output even when it doesn't throw.\n\nLive-validated against a real custom data entry form: a BOOLEAN data\nelement whose stored template still had value=\"[ ... Multi-grade ... ]\"\nbaked in reproduced the exact crash, since the hyphen in \"Multi-grade\"\nforms an invalid descending character-class range.\n\nReplace the regex call with a plain assignment expressing the actual\nintent, independent of the tag's attribute content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"e41fb72bba900d807435b0676a6bc1371db9890e","tree_id":"57a323405acd4dd063c6d5f4134c323c12d02b1e","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:00:59Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url